# Host test binaries are build outputs, never artifacts. Committing them made
# `make test` run a stale binary instead of rebuilding from the .c beside it,
# and one built on a newer x86-64 baseline than the CI runner aborted with
# "CPU ISA level is lower than required" before executing a single assertion.
